{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No generative AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic Trains 1 2 &amp; 3 included in the game folder.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1) Create a network of trains, busses and planes to connect all the towns together and overseas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2) Multi stage resource harvesting and transporting. Ore, Ingots and export goods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3) Make airports to transport people and mail around the map or overseas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4) Build airports, train stations, truck depots and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5) Import goods from overseas and ship them to towns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6) 20 Resources to transport from mail to oil. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7) Procedurally generated maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8) Maintain fleets of trucks, trains and planes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9) Large array of trains, trucks, planes and ships to build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10) Run a transportation empire from 1950 into the modern day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522040/extras/72b2d68f2b520e2a22aec31629a979da.poster.avif?t=1758924018\" width=480 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522040/extras/72b2d68f2b520e2a22aec31629a979da.webm?t=1758924018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522040/extras/72b2d68f2b520e2a22aec31629a979da.mp4?t=1758924018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2522040?t=1758924018","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522040/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758924018","capsule_imag